"Free points belong to Markus Brown alone; no native has ever heard of such a thing."
"Markus gains free points besides his regular points each level, which makes his growth so fast."
"Markus first earned 1 free point per level for each 10 points of Spirit."
"Box: \"[For each ten points in Spirit, you have been awarded a free point to spend on Arcana"
"…\"or Constitution per level. You have 8 free points available.]\""
"Markus's free points could first go only to Arcana or Constitution, never Spirit."
"At Spirit 100 Markus was told: \"[Free points can now be spent on either Strength or Agility."
"…\"Please choose an attribute.]\" He chose Agility."
"Free points still cannot be spent on Spirit."
"At 250 Spirit Markus gained 25 free points a level, far more than his regular points."
"As Champion, Markus gains 1 free point per 20 Spirit instead of per 10."
"As Champion, Markus can gain many more free points through quests and Faith."
"Free points cannot be turned into Faith; only regular points can."
"After his fight against Randall's apostle, Markus held about 700 free and 200 regular points."
